00:07:27.110 --> 00:07:34.169
votes for third parties, new parties, minor
parties are effectively wasted. And so all

00:07:34.169 --> 00:07:38.849
the all the energy and focus goes into the
top two parties and it's very hard for new

00:07:38.849 --> 00:07:45.889
